    "evidence": "The “one payment, two answers” reveal is a clear demo narrative, and the signed-intent versus paid-cart mismatch with side-by-side ALLOW/BLOCK outcomes gives the screen a recognizable forensic moment. However, its visual language—dark grid, monospace labels, neon cyan/red pills, dense event table—remains familiar cybersecurity-dashboard territory. Tablet and especially mobile turn the centerpiece into a long operational feed, weakening the reveal. The header also clips most navigation at smaller viewports, reducing polish.",
